 "description": "<h1>HOTEL ANGMAGSSALIK</h1><div><p>Greenland&acute;s most established tourist hotel is renowned for its magnificent location.</p></div><p>Hotel Angmagssalik established in December 1973, the 40th season season. Overlooking a picturesque town, sheltered fjord and majestic mountains. The hotel is fully modernised, yet retains its friendly, informal style.</p><p>The hotel has 40 rooms with private facilities, Deluxe, Twin and triple rooms avaible.</p><p>internet access.: &nbsp; WIFI &nbsp; &nbsp; 1/2 hr. 50&nbsp;DKR. &nbsp;1 hr. &nbsp;75 DKR. &nbsp; 2 hrs. 100 DKR.&nbsp;</p><p>The dining and lounge areas fully modernised with a fantastic terrasse overlooking the town of Tasiilaq.</p><p>Souvenir shop with fine local arts and crafts.</p>",
